-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE (please read)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This license covers ONLY the original application-layer code authored for
Nebula Baize (the agent gateway, runtime, skills, serve/ web frontend, tools,
and configs in this workspace).

It does NOT cover the Strata inference engine. This workspace is a pure
application layer that connects to a separately-installed Strata engine at
runtime over a network endpoint (--url http://127.0.0.1:8080/v1, see
run_standalone.bat). The Strata engine and its native backend (src/, include/,
metal/, sycl/, third_party/) are NOT bundled or shipped inside this release,
so no Strata source copy travels with the distribution and no upstream source
notice is triggered for it.

The engine, if you choose to ship it WITH your package, is licensed under MIT
(c) 2026 Niko1221 and the Strata contributors, and its native backend carries
its own per-component licenses. In that case, list them in THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES
and keep their notices. If you keep the engine as a runtime prerequisite (user
supplies Strata, or it runs on your server), you owe no Strata notice — only the
permissive-license attribution for the bundled Python dependencies below.

See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES for the bundled runtime dependencies' licenses.
